OL,3,GNEWSA'I am 63 but the test says I have
OL,4,Athe heart of a 76-year-old'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It says I have the same risk of a
OL,7,Fheart attack or stroke as a
OL,8,F76-year-old. That's worrying," said
OL,9,F63-year-old Dave Tutton.
OL,11,FHe had visited his GP surgery in
OL,12,FBuckinghamshire for an asthma check-up
OL,13,Fbut was also offered an at-home heart
OL,14,Ftesting kit.
OL,16,FThe finger-prick tests deliver results
OL,17,Fin minutes via an app and are being
OL,18,Foffered to patients at some GP
OL,19,Fsurgeries in the Thames Valley.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
